  <!-- ══ 10. MULTI-SIG CEREMONY ══ -->
  <div class="wp-section" id="s10">
    <h2><span class="sec-num">10</span> Multi-Signature Decryption Ceremony</h2>
    <p>Results cannot be decrypted by any single person. The ceremony requires 5 of 9 authorized CEP signatories to each contribute their decryption key shard, verified by biometric liveness detection.</p>

    <h3>10.1 Authorized Signatories</h3>
    <div class="wp-table-wrap">
      <table class="wp-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Title</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>cep_president</td><td>Prezidan CEP</td><td>Signatory (key holder)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>cep_vice_president</td><td>Vis-Prezidan CEP</td><td>Signatory (key holder)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>cep_secretary_general</td><td>Sekretè Jeneral CEP</td><td>Signatory (key holder)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>cep_member_1 through cep_member_6</td><td>Manm Konsèy CEP (6 seats)</td><td>Signatory (key holder)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>international_observer</td><td>Obsèvatè Entènasyonal (OEA/ONU)</td><td>Observer (non-signing)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>bonid_technical_director</td><td>Direktè Teknik BonID</td><td>Observer (non-signing)</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3>10.2 Ceremony Protocol</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>1. Identity Verification:</strong> Each signatory scans their BonID QR code.</li>
      <li><strong>2. Liveness Check:</strong> Biometric face match + anti-spoofing liveness detection confirms physical presence.</li>
      <li><strong>3. Key Shard Entry:</strong> Signatory enters their unique decryption key shard.</li>
      <li><strong>4. Signature Record:</strong> ElectionSignature record created with bonid, role, key_shard_hash, liveness_verified, and timestamp.</li>
      <li><strong>5. Quorum Check:</strong> After each signature, system checks if 5+ signatures have been collected.</li>
      <li><strong>6. Key Reconstruction:</strong> 5+ key shards combined via Shamir's Secret Sharing to reconstruct master decryption key.</li>
      <li><strong>7. Results Published:</strong> Aggregate vote counts per candidate displayed with Merkle root integrity proof.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="wp-infobox yellow">
      <strong>Why 5-of-9?</strong> This threshold ensures no faction of fewer than 5 CEP members can unilaterally access results, while allowing the ceremony to proceed even if up to 4 members are unavailable. This is the same threshold used by major financial institutions for multi-signature wallets.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ 11. DIASPORA VOTING ══ -->
  <div class="wp-section" id="s11">
    <h2><span class="sec-num">11</span> Diaspora Voting</h2>
    <p>BonVote enables diaspora voting through two channels: the BonID mobile app (remote) and kiosk tablets at Haitian diplomatic missions (consulate). The BallotRoutingService automatically determines the correct ballot based on the voter's BonID location code.</p>

    <h3>11.1 Ballot Routing Logic</h3>
    <p>The BonID format encodes the voter's department or country at the 4th segment (e.g., VP-1970-M-<strong>ND</strong>-P2334-4EC for domestic Nord, VP-1985-F-<strong>US</strong>-K7721-9AB for diaspora US).</p>
    <div class="wp-table-wrap">
      <table class="wp-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Location Code</th><th>Type</th><th>Ballot Sections</th><th>Positions</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>OU, ND, SD, AR, NE, NO, SE, CE, GA, NI</td><td>Domestic</td><td>3 sections</td><td>President + Senator + Deputy</td></tr>
          <tr><td>US, CA, FR, DO, CL, BR, etc.</td><td>Diaspora</td><td>1 section</td><td>President only</td></tr>
          <tr><td>HT (generic)</td><td>Domestic (default)</td><td>3 sections</td><td>President + Senator + Deputy</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3>11.2 Consulate Voting Stations</h3>
    <p>BonVote supports 45+ Haitian diplomatic missions worldwide as voting stations. Each consulate operates a kiosk tablet with the BonID voting interface. Kiosk votes skip geolocation lookup and are tagged with consulate_id and station_id for audit.</p>
  </div>

